# Lines that "uv pip check" may report in the Press image, and only these (press.Dockerfile).
# frappe-mcp is pinned to Werkzeug 3.1.3 and pydantic ~=2.11.7. Frappe 16 pins Werkzeug 3.1.9 and
# pydantic 2.12.5, and the image keeps Frappe's versions. Evidence that the newer versions are
# harmless for frappe-mcp is in docs/dagitim/press-imaji.md (frappe-mcp test run).
The package `frappe-mcp` requires `pydantic~=2.11.7`, but `2.12.5` is installed
The package `frappe-mcp` requires `werkzeug==3.1.3`, but `3.1.9` is installed
